<main class="sb-home">
  <section class="sb-hero">
    <div class="sb-hero-content">
      <p class="sb-eyebrow">GOOD FOOD, BETTER TOGETHER</p>

      <h1>
        Your group.<br>
        Your cravings.<br>
        <span>One place to agree on.</span>
      </h1>

      <p class="sb-hero-description">
        Planning lunch, dinner, or another meal out?
        Swipe together to find a restaurant that fits your group.
      </p>

      <div class="sb-hero-actions">
        <%= link_to "Plan a group meal →", new_nomikai_path, class: "sb-button" %>
        <%= link_to "See how it works ↓", "#how-it-works", class: "sb-text-link" %>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="sb-phone-area" aria-label="Preview of restaurant cards">
      <div class="sb-swipe-note">Swipe, decide,<br>eat together.</div>

      <article class="sb-restaurant-card">
        <img
          src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1555939594-58d7cb561ad1?w=700"
          alt="A table of grilled food to share"
        >

        <div class="sb-card-details">
          <span class="sb-match">★ Group favorite</span>
          <h2>Yakitori House</h2>
          <p>📍 Shinjuku</p>
          <p>⭐ 4.4 · Japanese izakaya</p>
        </div>

        <div class="sb-card-actions" aria-hidden="true">
          <span class="sb-card-dislike">×</span>
          <span class="sb-heart">♥</span>
        </div>
      </article>

      <div class="sb-floating-card" aria-hidden="true">
        <img
          src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1569718212165-3a8278d5f624?w=400"
          alt=""
        >
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="sb-how" id="how-it-works">
    <div class="sb-section-heading">
      <p class="sb-eyebrow">SIMPLE FOR THE WHOLE GROUP</p>
      <h2>From “where should we eat?” to a group pick.</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="sb-steps">
      <article class="sb-step">
        <span class="sb-step-number">01</span>
        <div class="sb-step-icon" aria-hidden="true">📅</div>
        <h3>Create an event</h3>
        <p>Choose the location, time, group size, and budget for your meal out.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="sb-step">
        <span class="sb-step-number">02</span>
        <div class="sb-step-icon" aria-hidden="true">👋</div>
        <h3>Invite your group</h3>
        <p>Share the link so everyone can join and add their preferences.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="sb-step">
        <span class="sb-step-number">03</span>
        <div class="sb-step-icon" aria-hidden="true">🍽️</div>
        <h3>Swipe and choose</h3>
        <p>Browse restaurant ideas together and find a place that works for the group.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="sb-benefits" id="why-swipe-and-bite">
    <div class="sb-benefits-content">
      <p class="sb-eyebrow">MADE FOR GROUP MEALS</p>
      <h2>Less chat. More choosing together.</h2>
      <p class="sb-benefits-intro">
        Everyone gets a say, so it’s easier to settle on a restaurant
        for lunch, dinner, or your next meal out.
      </p>

      <div class="sb-benefit-grid">
        <div class="sb-benefit">
          <span aria-hidden="true">👥</span>
          <span>Make the decision as a group</span>
        </div>
        <div class="sb-benefit">
          <span aria-hidden="true">💴</span>
          <span>Keep your budget in mind</span>
        </div>
        <div class="sb-benefit">
          <span aria-hidden="true">🥗</span>
          <span>Consider everyone’s preferences</span>
        </div>
        <div class="sb-benefit">
          <span aria-hidden="true">✨</span>
          <span>Discover restaurant options</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="sb-cta">
    <p class="sb-eyebrow">YOUR NEXT GROUP MEAL</p>
    <h2>Ready to find a place everyone can enjoy?</h2>
    <p>Create an event, invite your group, and start choosing together.</p>
    <%= link_to "Plan a group meal →", new_nomikai_path, class: "sb-button" %>
  </section>
</main>

<footer class="sb-footer">
  <%= link_to "🍴 Swipe & Bite", root_path, class: "sb-logo" %>

  <nav aria-label="Footer">
    <%= link_to "How it works", "#how-it-works" %>
    <%= link_to "About", about_path %>
  </nav>

  <span>Good food, better together.</span>
</footer>
